# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# WC Roadmap configuration. Copy to .env.local and adjust. ALL values optional:
# with no env at all, the SPA runs against the committed mock fixture (the `auto`
# provider falls back to mock when FIFA is unreachable). These are build-time
# Vite client keys (VITE_*) inlined into the static bundle — not secrets.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Which data provider to use (read by src/data/config/fifa-config.ts).
#   auto  -> FIFA when reachable, otherwise the mock fixture (default)
#   fifa  -> force the official FIFA API (api.fifa.com/api/v3)
#   mock  -> force the bundled offline fixture (deterministic, no network)
# VITE_FIFA_PROVIDER=auto

# FIFA API origin (no trailing path). Defaults to the FIFA v3 base.
# VITE_FIFA_BASE_URL=https://api.fifa.com/api/v3

# FIFA World Cup 2026 identifiers (verified against api.fifa.com/api/v3).
# VITE_FIFA_COMPETITION_ID=17
# VITE_FIFA_SEASON_ID=285023

# Country hint forwarded to FIFA (mirrors the fifa.com ?country= param). Defaults
# to US and is ALWAYS sent as ?country=US. Set it to an empty string to omit the
# param entirely; that is the ONLY way to drop it.
# VITE_FIFA_COUNTRY=US
